==== BringToBearSound ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for weapons. The parameter specifies the sound that will be played when aiming starts.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
BringToBearSound = M1911BringToBear,
</syntaxhighlight>
